hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"37","[AI-translation] Nafi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] ne ek sardi aur hawa wali raat mein namaz ke liye azan kahi, phir kaha: Khabardar, apne thikanon mein namaz padho. Phir kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) muazzin ko hukm farmate jab thandi barish wali raat hoti ke woh kahe: 'Khabardar, apne thikanon mein namaz padho.'"
"38","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Apne munadi ko barish wali raat ya thandi hawa wali raat mein hukm farmate: 'Khabardar, apne thikanon mein namaz padho.'"
"39","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum nida [azan] suno to wahi kaho jo muazzin kehta hai.'"
"40","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Alqamah bin Waqqas (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak main Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas tha jab un ke muazzin ne azan kahi. To Mu'awiyah ne wahi kaha jo un ke muazzin ne kaha, yahan tak ke jab [Hayya alas-salah] tak pahunche to kaha: 'La haula wa la quwwata illa billah [Allah ke siwa na koi taqat na quwwat].' Aur jab us ne [Hayya alal-falah] kaha to kaha: 'La haula wa la quwwata illa billah.' Phir us ke ba'd wahi kaha jo muazzin ne kaha, phir kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko aisa hi farmate suna."
"41","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr aur Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) qiraat ka aaghaz ﴿الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ﴾ [Al-Fatihah: 2] se farmate."
"42","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr, Umar aur Usman (Raziyallahu anhum) qiraat ka aaghaz ﴿الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ﴾ se farmate."
"43","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr, Umar aur Usman (Raziyallahu anhum) namaz ka aaghaz ﴿الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ﴾ [Al-Fatihah: 2] se farmate."
"44","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mu'awiyah ne Madinah mein namaz padhai to us mein buland aawaz se qiraat farmai. To unhon ne Ummul Quran [Al-Fatihah] ke liye ﴿بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَنِ الرَّحِيمِ﴾ [Al-Fatihah: 1] padhi, aur us ke ba'd wali surat ke liye use nahin padha, yahan tak ke woh namaz poori kar li; aur jab sajde ke liye jhukte to takbeer nahin kehte, yahan tak ke woh namaz poori kar li. Phir jab use Muhajireen aur Ansar mein se har taraf se sunne walon ne pukara: Ai Mu'awiyah, kya tum ne namaz churai hai? Ya bhool gaye ho?! Ravi kehte hain: Phir jab us ke ba'd unhon ne namaz padhai to Ummul Quran ke ba'd wali surat ke liye ﴿بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَنِ الرَّحِيمِ﴾ [Al-Fatihah: 1] padhi, aur jab sajde ke liye jhukte to takbeer kehte."
"45","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum apne sathi se kaho: Khamosh raho, jabke imam khutba de raha ho, to beshak tum ne laghw [bekar baat] ki.'"
"46","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum apne sathi se kaho: Khamosh raho, to beshak tum ne laghw kiya.' Is se Aap ki murad Jume ke din hai jab imam khutba de raha ho."
